\par\par \b \uc2 Dow Jones Top Markets Headlines at 1 AM ET: Oil prices, stock futures inch higher as U.S. and Iran reportedly agree to halt attacks | U.S. ...\b0\par\par\uc2 480 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 June 2026\par 07:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Oil prices, stock futures inch higher as U.S. and Iran reportedly agree to halt attacks\par \par \uc2 Oil prices rose Sunday and U.S. stock-index futures advanced, after the U.S. and Iran reportedly agreed to halt attacks after repeatedly exchanging fire in the Persian Gulf over the weekend.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 U.S. and Iran Agree to Stop Fight Over the Strait of Hormuz\par \par \uc2 The two sides are set to resume peace talks intended to strike a long-term deal to end hostilities and restrain Tehran's nuclear program.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 BIS Sees Peril for Economy, Financial System in AI Investment Boom\par \par \uc2 Fierce competition will dominate \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  risks driving investment spending to excessive levels that could tip some economies into recession, the \uc2 Bank for International Settlements\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 The Trillion-Dollar Borrowing Binge Lifting the Stock Market to Risky Heights\par \par \uc2 Leveraged funds and margin debt have grown to unprecedented levels this year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 How Some Private-Equity Managers Collect Big Fees on Paper Gains\par \par \uc2 The fee structures are among the pitfalls of investing in semiliquid funds.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Forget the 'Sell America' trade: Why U.S. markets keep proving the naysayers wrong\par \par \uc2 Foreign investors are still pouring money into U.S. assets, and the dollar remains the undisputed global reserve currency.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Trump Threatens 100% Tariff on European Countries That Impose Digital Services Tax\par \par \uc2 The threat comes a day after the \uc2 European Union\uc2  approved tariff reductions on U.S. goods.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Chip Makers Are Profiting Off AI at the Expense of Just About Everyone Else\par \par \uc2 We are witnessing an extraordinary transfer of cash from the providers of AI-and, perhaps one day, AI users-to memory-chip makers.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 AI turbocharged the stock market. Now it's firing up the economy.\par \par \uc2 A modern-day gold rush is giving a big boost to U.S. GDP.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Kevin Warsh\uc2  Invokes \uc2 Alan Greenspan\uc2  to Shrink the Fed-and Strengthen Its Chair\par \par \uc2 The approach of the new \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  head might not always align with the standard his predecessor set.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Week Ahead for FX, Bonds: U.S. Jobs Data in Focus as Markets Search for Clues on Fed Rate Path\par \par \uc2 U.S. jobs data could confirm indications that the economy is robust as investors gauge whether and when the Fed might raise interest rates.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Bond yields are falling as inflation pops. The Fed's tough talk under Warsh is helping.\par \par \uc2 Kevin Warsh\uc2 , the new Federal Reserve chair, is helping coax Treasury yields lower by talking tough on inflation.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Fed's Kashkari Says the Fed May Have to Raise Rates This Year\par \par \uc2 Minneapolis Fed\uc2  President \uc2 Neel Kashkari\uc2  said inflation risks have led him to pencil in one rate hike by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 29, 2026 01:00 ET (05:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260629em6t00097\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
