 results and encourages investors to review other factors that may affect its future results in HPAI's registration statement and other filings with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For more information, please contact:\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Helport AI Investor Relations\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Email: ir@helport.ai\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Website: ir.helport.ai\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The accompanying unaudited condensed consolidated financial statements should be read together with the notes thereto included in the Company's Form 6-K furnished with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on June 26, 2026. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par                            HELPORT AI LIMITED \par                   CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED BALANCE SHEETS \par           (Amounts in U.S. dollars ("US$" or "$"), except share \par                                   data) \par  \par                                               As of          As of \par                                            December 31,     June 30, \par                                               2025           2025 \par                                          ---------------  ----------- \par                                            (Unaudited)     (Audited) \par Cash                                      $      688,112  $   152,051 \par Accounts receivable, net                      34,973,991   23,466,286 \par Amount due from a related party                  123,219       10,372 \par Prepaid expenses and other receivables           198,001      137,669 \par                                              -----------   ---------- \par Total current assets                          35,983,323   23,766,378 \par                                              -----------   ---------- \par  \par Long-term investment                               2,461       29,643 \par Intangible assets, net                        16,061,400   12,680,011 \par Right-of-use assets, net     